{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"12016","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v1783","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"憂姫はぐれ","creatorId":"vndb:s3342","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2415","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3342","name":"憂姫はぐれ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:75081","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"反転星","creatorId":"vndb:s8712","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1333","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8712","name":"反転星","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:75082","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"Barbarian On The Groove","creatorId":"vndb:s1049","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2563","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1049","name":"Barbarian On The Groove","detail":"主題歌","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:79539","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"流歌(Reliance:Tone)","creatorId":"vndb:s4627","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5700","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4627","name":"流歌(Reliance:Tone)","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:79541","source":"egs"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"神月社","creatorId":"vndb:s4003","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:12716","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4003","name":"神月社","detail":"ムービー","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:109291","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"Miglen","creatorId":"vndb:s9701","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:14077","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9701","name":"Miglen","detail":"主題歌「銀河のファンタジー」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:79540","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"憂姫 はぐれ","creatorId":"vndb:s3342","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3342","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3342","name":"憂姫 はぐれ","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:28325","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"神月 社","creatorId":"vndb:s4003","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4003","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4003","name":"神月 社","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:28327","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Miglen","creatorId":"vndb:s9701","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9701","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9701","name":"Miglen","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:28330","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c32946","characterName":"フローラ・ド・アークアデア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14340","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15967"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15764"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32946"},"originalCharacterName":"フローラ・ド・アークアデア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The first princess of Arcadare. Flola is a very easygoing and friendly woman, the oldest of the sisters. She cares for Maria, Elena and Miria very much. She sometimes likes to tease her sisters, especially Maria, but receiving an aggressive response from her, feigns sadness in a fun way. Flola has also developed a complex for her big breasts because her \"Tit Dance\" is famous throughout the Universe for its peace-making effect on hostile ambassadors from different civilizations. Through, no body knows how much hard work is hidden behind her kind smile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32946"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークアデア皇国第一皇女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした性格でマイペース。ちょっとボケたところがあり、よくマリアに突っ込まれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みんなに優しく、いつも妹や国民のこと気にかけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年上なのに柔らかい印象とからかい甲斐があるため、妹のマリアやエレナにいつもおもちゃにされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性らしさが強調されたその体つきに、国民の前に姿を現すと「青少年に悪影響を与える」と各方面から苦情が殺到する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人も、恥ずかしいほど育ってしまった胸にコンプレックスを抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に皇女として欠点とも言える問題が発生してしまっているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眠くなってくると、エロモードが発動する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15764","sourceWorkId":"12016","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークアデア皇国第一皇女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした性格でマイペース。ちょっとボケたところがあり、よくマリアに突っ込まれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みんなに優しく、いつも妹や国民のことを気にかけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年上だが からかい甲斐があるため、妹のマリアやエレナにいつもおもちゃにされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性らしさが強調された体つきのせいで、国民の前に姿を現すと 「青少年に悪影響を与える」と言われ、各方面から苦情が殺到する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人も恥ずかしいほど育ってしまった胸にコンプレックスを抱いている。特に皇女として欠点とも言える問題が発生してしまっているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眠くなってくると、エロモードが発動する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14340"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/0604d26a1d05848338484215b9cef33319ebcb76ff2384cd3162439ac0721e7e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7bdf4e2720a3f5d914f2ffdda32dac3a611981c0b478cecd1fb479a45217b69.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"たかはし智秋","creatorId":"vndb:s287","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s287","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s287","name":"たかはし 智秋","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:15967:14340:4604:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32947","characterName":"マリア・ド・アークアデア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14341","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15967"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15765"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32947"},"originalCharacterName":"マリア・ド・アークアデア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The second princess of Arcadare. She is very stubborn, short-tempered and strong to the core, and isn't all that interested in Mamoru. What she admires in a man is coolness and wealth... Despite this, she starts liking him slowly and warming up to him. She loves her twin sister, Miria very much and thus, is sometimes a tad bit overprotective of her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Loosely translated from the Getchu Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32947"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークアデア皇国第二皇女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"芯の強い、ちょっと怒りん坊なお姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼りない姉とのんびり屋と不思議キャラな妹に囲まれ、結果的に姉妹の世話焼き係になってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、双子の妹であるミリアのことが大好きで、過保護なほど気にかけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強情な性格が災いし、こうと思ったら絶対に考えを変えない為、マリアを理解できない人からはあまり良い顔をされない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平民の男に全く興味が無いが、自己犠牲でみんなを守ろうとしたマモルのことが少し気になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フローラらにマモルとの仲の良さを指摘されると、顔を真っ赤にして否定する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"宇宙一の金持ちでカッコいい男が好みだと言い張るが、マモルの優しさに触れ段々と……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15765","sourceWorkId":"12016","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークアデア皇国第二皇女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"芯の強い、ちょっと怒りん坊なお姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼りない姉や、のんびり屋と不思議キャラな妹に囲まれ、結果的に姉妹の世話焼き係になってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、双子の妹であるミリアのことが大好きで、過保護なまでに気にかけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"こうと思ったら絶対に考えを変えない強情な性格が災いし、彼女を理解できない人からはあまり良い顔をされない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平民の男にまったく興味は無いが、自己犠牲でみんなを守ろうとしたマモルのことが少し気になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしフローラらにマモルとの仲の良さを指摘されると、顔を真っ赤にして否定する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"宇宙一の金持ちでカッコいい男が好みだと言い張るが、マモルの優しさに触れ段々と……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14341"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63ea3f64539257756d38f0d6265f324be22508bfc3eb1e7c654fe66a67d9af82.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8d3e037ce27867557cda3620dc163e5553431c448d028d59eab11877213b34ae.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"今井麻美","creatorId":"vndb:s240","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s240","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s240","name":"今井 麻美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:15967:14341:4061:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32948","characterName":"ミリア・ド・アークアデア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14342","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15967"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15766"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32948"},"originalCharacterName":"ミリア・ド・アークアデア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The third princess of Arcadare. Despite being very carefree and laidback, Miria is very shy and hasn't talked to the boys before, and thanks to that, she doesn't have much friends. Whenever Miria is with Maria, she hides behind her back, as soon as she meets a stranger, especially a man. However, Miria wants to evolve and gain more courage, thus, she thinks it's finally the time to become braver by talking to Mamoru and his friends. Not to mention, she feels something special for Mamoru..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Loosely translated from the Getchu Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32948"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークアデア皇国第三皇女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"のんびりした性格で、美味い物を食べると幸せそうな顔になる、ほわほわしたお姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フローラのような優しく綺麗な皇女になりたいと、いつも思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、引っ込み思案で自分から知らない人に声をかけられないため、友達がほとんどいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも双子の姉であるマリアに、ひよこのようにくっついて歩いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男の子とほとんど喋った事が無いため、この機会にマモルと友達になれたら、と考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自信がなく人前であがってしまう性格は皇女として問題とマリアに指摘され、マモルはミリアの弱点克服の手助けをすることになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、ミリアはマモルに友達以上の何かを感じ……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15766","sourceWorkId":"12016","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークアデア皇国第三皇女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"のんびりした性格で、美味い物を食べると幸せそうな顔になる、ほわほわしたお姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フローラのような優しく綺麗な皇女になりたいと、いつも思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし引っ込み思案で自分から知らない人に声をかけられないため、友達がほとんどいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも双子の姉であるマリアに、ひよこのようにくっついて歩いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今まで男の子とほとんど喋ったことが無いため、この機会にマモルと友達になれたらいいなと考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自信がなく人前であがってしまう性格は皇女として問題とマリアに指摘され、マモルに弱点克服の手助けをしてもらうことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、マモルに友達以上の何かを感じ……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14342"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/447fa024ed1fc3bd932b9d3a7cc56256ef4309ba3120742b62bdf1d2f9719e88.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/39c26e2f2d6a9a0219c46535bd07f73db3ef7daf03cd03a0d13966f0dd8877e3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林桂子","creatorId":"vndb:s443","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s443","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s443","name":"美月(声優)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:15967:14342:16180:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32949","characterName":"エレナ・ド・アークアデア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14343","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15967"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15767"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32949"},"originalCharacterName":"エレナ・ド・アークアデア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Elena is a 4th Arcadare princess. She looks phlegmatic, but in fact she has a subtle sense of humor, although sometimes she just fools around. For a long time, Elena has been trying to summon someone from the magic circle, and Mamoru have to play the role of a sacrifice for her rituals. When it comes to Sacred Orb extracting, Elena spares no efforts to arouse Mamoru in the most fetishistic ways. Also, Elena is a vessel for Rain, the strong demon, that was sealed inside her body."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32949"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークアデア皇国第四皇女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で大人しく、普段何を考えているのか誰にもわからない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言語学、宇宙科学に長け、銀河学会の宇宙誌でもその名を良くみかけるほどの天才お姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供の頃から何故か召還術を行い、生贄によくフローラを使っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何度失敗しても諦めないエレナ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どうやら何かを呼び出そうとしているようだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15767","sourceWorkId":"12016","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークアデア皇国第四皇女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で大人しく、普段なにを考えているのか誰にもわからない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言語学や宇宙科学に長け、銀河学会の宇宙誌でもその名を良くみかけるほどの天才お姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供の頃からなぜか召還術を行い、生贄によくフローラを使っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何度失敗しても諦めることはなく、どうやら何かを呼び出そうとしているようだが……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14343"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/8003c80c28569a9a7bc4e936359681190e4074781366622671ff16ad1f54876d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/700e92f91b5538ea4c0debcc029e100dd548d23015e4a7d02d870c2255d5766f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青葉りんご","creatorId":"vndb:s295","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s295","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s295","name":"青葉 りんご","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:15967:14343:5922:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32951","characterName":"リレット・オルトフォン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14344","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15967"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15768"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32951"},"originalCharacterName":"リレット・オルトフォン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The maid of the Arcadare family who can do many jobs, and serves also as the princesses' bodyguard. A very goofy and energetic girl who is also a cosmic masochist; she enjoys making people angry. Since it's common for commoners in the kingdom of Arcadare to not wear panties, Lillet doesn't wear any, and keeps doing this even after coming to Earth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Loosely translated from the Getchu Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32951"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"姫様がたの侍女でありメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身の回りのお世話からボディーガードまでこなしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はおっちょこちょいで慌てん坊。注意力が散漫で、良く掃除中に飾ってある物を壊す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"これでも侍女が勤まっていることから、宇宙の七不思議のひとつに数えられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"宇宙的マゾ。怒られたりすると、とても喜ぶ。わざと怒られている感もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークアデアでは平民はパンツを穿けないので、地球に来ても常にパンツを穿いていない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15768","sourceWorkId":"12016","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"姫様がたの侍女でありメイド。身の回りのお世話からボディーガードまでこなしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はおっちょこちょいで慌てん坊。注意力が散漫で、よく掃除中に飾ってある物を壊す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"これでも侍女が勤まっていることから、宇宙の七不思議のひとつに数えられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"宇宙的マゾ。怒られたりすると、とても喜ぶ。わざと怒られている感もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークアデアでは平民はパンツを穿けないので、地球に来ても常にパンツを穿いていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14344"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/9865e8d20212a8338db0cdba26b90c85b95bfd50af0799b7505ff43253fc6849.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14bc1cd0bfed47b00189624e0bcf648f9a8c3552c1620bdb02b33fd00e3283e4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田口宏子","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:15967:14344:5020:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32952","characterName":"レイン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14345","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15967"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15769"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32952"},"originalCharacterName":"レイン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rain is a demon famous for her great strength, skillful magic and dodgy mind. But she was sealed once by Silver inside Elena's body. Though, when Elena drops her guard, Rain comes out and tries her best to extract the Sacred Orb from Mamoru and use it for her own purposes. Despite how much trouble Rain caused to the princesses and all the Arcadare people in the past, she deserves some compassion. After all, her whole long life was spent in solitude, without close friends and beloved man."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32952"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"宇宙を震撼させた大悪魔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔、エレナの召還術が失敗し、アークアデアの地に呼び出されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"破壊の限りを尽くそうとするが、リレットの父である神官シルバーによって召還したエレナの中に封じられてしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ところが、エレナが地球に来た影響で封印が弱まり、くしゃみと共についに地上に現れてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母体であるエレナを通じて聖玉のことを知り、それを食らえば自分をパワーアップできると考え、姫たちと同様マモルに性的な誘いをかけるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フローラよりいやらしい体つきのレインは、最も聖玉を得易いポジションにいるようだが、しかし……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに、２５６年間破壊の限りを尽くし、人々に恐れられているレインにも、実は悩みがあるらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15769","sourceWorkId":"12016","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"宇宙を震撼させた大悪魔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔、エレナの召還術が失敗し、アークアデアの地に呼び出されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"破壊の限りを尽くそうとするが、リレットの父である神官・シルバーによって召還したエレナの中に封じられてしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ところが、エレナが地球に来た影響で封印が弱まり、くしゃみと共に地上に現れてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母体であるエレナを通じて聖玉のことを知り、それを食らえば自分をパワーアップできると考え、姫たちと同様マモルに性的な誘いをかけるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フローラよりいやらしい体つきで、最も聖玉を得やすいポジションにいるようだが、しかし……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに、256年間破壊の限りを尽くし、人々に恐れられているレインにも、実は悩みがあるらしい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14345"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6ae981bfc9d893521fb4d1023dc4dc7ee09280ac71d337cda45ead89fe7c1c0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c3f33b59223d8ee5d6a71582f0e54128cf50f37dec3d88c88da39d76e5aedf4a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"本井えみ","creatorId":"vndb:s124","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s124","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s124","name":"本井 えみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:15967:14345:4177:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c104819","characterName":"ハルカ様","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c104819"},"originalCharacterName":"ハルカ様","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The former ruler of Arcadare Empire, who was loved and respected by everyone, because she made Arcadare civilisation prosperous. She sacrificed her life to save Elena, and after that she became one of the spirits of the former rulers of Arcadare living in the Sacred Orb. Haruka was born on Earth."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c104819"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/372eed0b9e4c793b25e7c7e253bf875a6c65b254da3c8b965aae6759aa27def6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9caa8c5b9b40d73b680e9a66d57523bfa28262a9d736ccc082b72ead83db79b2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c104829","characterName":"小日向 マモル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c104829"},"originalCharacterName":"小日向 マモル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mamoru is a guy, who received the sacred extraterrestrial artefact in his body when he was a kid. So it's not surprising, that the aliens descended to Earth to take it back. The Sacred Orb can be extracted from his body through sex only, and the aliens are beautiful alien princesses, that looks exactly like women from Earth, so a wonderful adventures await this guy in the future."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c104829"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5efdaca92e7ce472d96740886dcf903c2c7422f13cc38a470fb91eeb36e3967.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1ca2240858c34c678ef036287b7101f7d103a4ed3c0c3b208d219f0d87d0e09a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c104830"